    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that but it just keeps oozing a bit and i'm worried if i just put a regular bandage on it it's gonna get soaked and then dirt will get in while i'm working. i have some hydrogen peroxide and some alcohol too. if i just drench it in those first to really kill everything deep inside, then maybe put a thick layer of ointment and wrap it tight, won't that be enough to keep it sterile until tomorrow?",
